@EnergyBackend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

GET {{EnergyBackend_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt

### Registrar factura con consumo en kWh y m³
POST {{EnergyBackend_HostAddress}}/api/Factura
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "casaId": 1,
  "numeroContrato": "CONTRATO-001",
  "fechaEmision": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "fechaPago": null,
  "consumoAcueductoM3": 12.5,
  "consumoAlcantarilladoM3": 12.5,
  "consumoEnergiaKwh": 185.75,
  "consumoGasM3": 8.25
}

### Consultar recomendaciones del trimestre más reciente por casa
GET {{EnergyBackend_HostAddress}}/api/Factura/recomendaciones-trimestrales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
